WEBVTT

00:00:02.510 --> 00:00:04.890
My lord likes Japanese green tea.

00:00:04.890 --> 00:00:07.970
But when I say that's akin to
a grandpa, he gets bummed out.

00:00:07.970 --> 00:00:10.050
My lord is quite the sleepyhead.

00:00:10.050 --> 00:00:14.680
He sometimes has bedhead. If you see
his hair sticking out, that's what it is.

00:00:14.680 --> 00:00:17.010
When my lord gets tired of paperwork,

00:00:17.010 --> 00:00:21.140
he sometimes lies on his stomach
on the couch and thrashes his legs.

00:00:22.430 --> 00:00:23.720
He's like a kid.

00:00:24.720 --> 00:00:28.430
My lord is secretly bothered
by the wrinkles on his forehead.

00:00:28.430 --> 00:00:31.180
He sometimes asks me,
"Do I have a shifty look in my eyes?"

00:00:31.180 --> 00:00:32.390
My lord is...

00:00:41.550 --> 00:00:48.140
Wallow in despair, seeing how
your subject for veneration is crushed!

00:00:48.140 --> 00:00:50.800
He's not my subject for veneration!

00:00:50.800 --> 00:00:55.590
My lord is my lord! He's not a
whatever the heck you're calling him!

