00:02:28.640 --> 00:02:32.340
If my lord is weak,
then I just need to be strong.

00:02:32.340 --> 00:02:35.720
If my lord oversleeps,
then I can just wake him up.

00:02:35.720 --> 00:02:40.840
If my lord is suffering, then I'll do
my best, and Naotsugu will help too.

00:02:40.840 --> 00:02:43.010
Moreover, he's got everyone!

00:02:43.300 --> 00:02:49.270
Song of the Nightingales

00:02:45.590 --> 00:02:48.010
"Song of the Nightingales."

00:02:49.430 --> 00:02:54.260
Lose hope, fearing that your
expectations will be betrayed!

00:02:54.260 --> 00:02:58.260
Even if my lord isn't strong,
that doesn't matter!

00:02:58.260 --> 00:03:01.260
I didn't join hands with him
because he was strong.

00:03:01.260 --> 00:03:05.260
It's not because he helped me
that I want to be by his side.

00:03:05.260 --> 00:03:10.970
It's not because he was strong
that I fell in love with him!

00:03:12.640 --> 00:03:14.640
It's like night and day

00:03:14.640 --> 00:03:17.970
even though we're both
looking at the same Shiroe...

00:03:19.970 --> 00:03:23.890
If my lord is in a fix,
I'll be in it with him!

00:03:23.890 --> 00:03:28.800
Since I'm a dummy, I'm not troubled
even if my lord is a dummy, too.

00:03:29.970 --> 00:03:32.550
I bet it'd be fun if
we got distressed together.

00:03:34.640 --> 00:03:40.680
When my lord is laughing,
things are a lot more fun!

00:03:40.680 --> 00:03:44.340
How can she be... so strong...?

00:03:44.340 --> 00:03:46.760
Even if my lord isn't strong...

00:03:46.760 --> 00:03:49.300
Even if my lord isn't Akiba's savior,

00:03:49.300 --> 00:03:56.760
nothing could change the happiness
that I feel when I'm with him!

00:03:56.760 --> 00:03:59.800
Fear the pain from despair!

00:04:03.140 --> 00:04:04.890
Akatsuki!

00:04:10.390 --> 00:04:15.340
You who cannot reach the rank
of veneration... Break into pieces!

00:04:18.390 --> 00:04:19.760
Sis!

00:04:24.010 --> 00:04:28.800
Are ranks... Are levels so important?

00:04:28.800 --> 00:04:31.930
Is that why you're acting
like a boss monkey?

00:04:31.930 --> 00:04:34.220
You probably wouldn't understand...

00:04:34.220 --> 00:04:37.720
...how I feel when I see new Adventurers
surpassing me one after another...

00:04:37.720 --> 00:04:42.140
I, who used to be the number one
Ancient warrior in our area.

00:04:42.140 --> 00:04:47.590
Oh no! This is bad! This is bad!
Sis's eyes have gotten so dark!

00:04:47.590 --> 00:04:50.220
We have to run! We have to run!

00:04:50.220 --> 00:04:53.140
You all are not worthy
of being subjects for venera--

00:04:53.140 --> 00:04:54.590
You clod!

00:04:54.590 --> 00:04:58.550
If you have a higher rank... If your level
goes up, you can become stronger.

00:04:58.550 --> 00:05:01.800
You can make friends.
People will gather around you.

00:05:01.800 --> 00:05:03.720
That's what you think, isn't it?!

00:05:03.720 --> 00:05:08.180
I can just smell that feeling of
ostracization coming from you!

00:05:08.180 --> 00:05:13.260
Lelia is a Monk. One of the
Monk's strong points is high agility.

00:05:13.260 --> 00:05:17.140
And yet, she's attacking head-on
and not even trying to evade

00:05:17.140 --> 00:05:21.050
in order to protect us by
getting Ereinus's attention!

00:05:24.260 --> 00:05:27.470
Litka!

00:05:27.470 --> 00:05:28.430
Y-Yes, ma'am!

00:05:28.430 --> 00:05:30.720
State the Izumo Knight's pledge!

00:05:30.720 --> 00:05:32.090
One!

00:05:32.090 --> 00:05:35.590
One! We should be the bridge between
the People of the Land and Adventurers!

00:05:36.090 --> 00:05:40.840
One! We should be the bridge between
the People of the Land and Adventurers!

00:05:40.840 --> 00:05:45.970
One! We should be the shield for
the weak and wings to carry hope!

00:05:45.970 --> 00:05:48.510
One! You can bring up
to three snacks. Bear in mind

00:05:48.510 --> 00:05:51.300
that you're still on an
excursion until you get home!

00:05:52.390 --> 00:05:55.430
We, the Mofur sisters, should be...

00:05:55.430 --> 00:05:59.340
...the guardians
for children who're afraid!

00:06:00.470 --> 00:06:05.680
Lose hope! Your subjects for
veneration will not show up here.

00:06:05.680 --> 00:06:08.800
You all will lose hope in here!

00:06:08.800 --> 00:06:12.180
We'll decide when we've lost hope!

00:06:12.180 --> 00:06:15.090
Here we... go!

00:06:18.640 --> 00:06:20.930
The leading expert in
being clumsy and unlucky!

00:06:20.930 --> 00:06:23.430
The older sister of the useless sisters!

00:06:23.430 --> 00:06:26.180
I, Lelia Mofur, will not give up!

00:06:26.180 --> 00:06:31.680
Lose hope! Your subjects for
veneration will not show up here.

00:06:31.680 --> 00:06:34.930
You all are isolated in here!

00:06:34.930 --> 00:06:36.590
Hm?

00:06:36.590 --> 00:06:38.220
Miss Isuzu?

00:06:38.220 --> 00:06:40.430
Adventurers are shiny!

00:06:40.430 --> 00:06:43.050
Litka is the Izumo Knights'...
Permanent Honorary Emperor

00:06:43.050 --> 00:06:47.680
who says good morning,
good afternoon, and good evening

00:06:47.680 --> 00:06:50.970
to Adventurers first!

00:06:50.970 --> 00:06:53.760
If you take away Litka's job,
it'll incur a great deal of anger...

00:06:53.760 --> 00:06:55.220
...from Litka's Sis!

00:06:55.220 --> 00:06:57.680
Just how do you see me?

00:06:57.680 --> 00:06:59.550
You are scary!

00:07:01.890 --> 00:07:03.640
Lose hope.

00:07:03.640 --> 00:07:05.010
Noise...?

00:07:06.260 --> 00:07:07.760
Hiya!

00:07:07.760 --> 00:07:09.930
Take this!

00:07:09.930 --> 00:07:12.430
Lose hope!

00:07:15.640 --> 00:07:17.340
Shiroe?

00:07:19.550 --> 00:07:23.590
So our Guild Master
started out just like us, huh?

00:07:23.590 --> 00:07:27.590
Their equipment was kinda...
how should I put it...

00:07:27.590 --> 00:07:32.260
They were beginners once, just like us.

00:07:32.260 --> 00:07:36.260
So the Mofur sisters
have been watching over us.

00:07:36.260 --> 00:07:41.470
Yeah, all of us Adventurers.

00:07:41.470 --> 00:07:43.760
We can't lose.

00:07:43.760 --> 00:07:47.140
Yeah. Because those two attracted
the enemy's attention for us,

00:07:47.140 --> 00:07:49.220
we now have some time to recover.

00:07:49.220 --> 00:07:51.300
Leave the healing to us!

00:07:51.300 --> 00:07:54.390
We have many healers this time!

00:07:54.390 --> 00:07:58.890
Lelia and Litka, too! If we don't
heal them, as it stands, they'll...!

00:07:58.890 --> 00:08:04.590
No! If we use magic on them now,
Ereinus will look this way!

00:08:04.590 --> 00:08:09.220
Minori! It's not reverberation or
delay that we're hearing in his voice!

00:08:09.220 --> 00:08:11.640
It's a chorus. A harmony!

00:08:11.640 --> 00:08:14.300
There's another one hiding in there!

