00:08:31.550 --> 00:08:33.640
Then...

00:08:33.640 --> 00:08:36.430
Informal Fully Controlled Combat!

00:08:36.430 --> 00:08:39.430
Full Control Encounter Limited!

00:08:42.180 --> 00:08:45.680
Everyone! Drink the
purple labeled portion!

00:08:45.680 --> 00:08:49.260
His light beam is purple!
It's a mental alignment attack!

00:08:49.260 --> 00:08:54.590
It's a wide-range attack that extracts
our MP to drain us and we can't evade it!

00:08:54.590 --> 00:08:57.180
We'll use the resistance potion!

00:08:57.180 --> 00:09:00.300
Toya! Mezamashi! Switch with Lelia!

00:09:00.300 --> 00:09:03.640
Shinomi! tateWaki!
Support the Mofur sisters!

00:09:00.300 --> 00:09:04.590
I'll keep them safe until they recover!

00:09:04.590 --> 00:09:07.560
Milky! Reduce the enemy's defense!

00:09:06.520 --> 00:09:08.340
Laser Edge!

00:09:08.340 --> 00:09:09.890
Rear guard! Support the attack!

00:09:09.890 --> 00:09:12.400
Vanguard! Prepare for a concerted attack!

00:09:09.890 --> 00:09:11.640
Divine Might!

00:09:11.640 --> 00:09:13.140
Secret Rite of Celestial Tread!

00:09:13.140 --> 00:09:16.800
I've been waiting for this! Round Carol!

00:09:16.800 --> 00:09:21.010
Miss Minori.
The warm welcome is ready to go!

00:09:21.010 --> 00:09:22.840
Recursion Syntax!

00:09:23.720 --> 00:09:28.470
Our enemy is level 65!
We can defeat an enemy in that range!

00:09:28.470 --> 00:09:33.090
It's the same as the many raids
that our seniors have beaten!

00:09:33.090 --> 00:09:35.300
There's no way we can't win!

00:09:37.090 --> 00:09:39.050
Astral Bind!

00:09:39.050 --> 00:09:40.930
Frigid Wind!

00:09:40.930 --> 00:09:43.090
Lightning Fall!

00:09:43.090 --> 00:09:45.720
Lightning Nebula!

00:09:45.720 --> 00:09:49.050
His movement is disturbed!
The real fight starts here!

00:09:49.050 --> 00:09:52.680
Rite of Divine Possession!
Coat of Minerva!

00:09:54.720 --> 00:10:01.140
Rite of Divine Possession powers up all
the skills I use for a given period of time.

00:10:02.840 --> 00:10:04.720
You look good in that.

00:10:04.720 --> 00:10:06.510
I'm Shiroe's apprentice, so...

00:10:06.510 --> 00:10:07.640
We're gonna win!

00:10:07.640 --> 00:10:08.840
Right!

00:10:09.970 --> 00:10:11.800
The white flames are coming!

00:10:11.800 --> 00:10:13.590
Mercy Rain!

00:10:13.590 --> 00:10:15.300
Life Burst!

00:10:23.390 --> 00:10:26.050
It's not possible to evade
those purple light beams,

00:10:26.050 --> 00:10:28.390
but if we step back very far,
they won't reach us.

00:10:28.390 --> 00:10:30.640
As long as I calculate the cycle...

00:10:31.550 --> 00:10:34.640
Use long range attacks
on the Reverence Genius!

00:10:34.640 --> 00:10:37.590
Use close range attacks
on the Despair Genius!

00:10:37.590 --> 00:10:39.180
Launch a concerted attack!

00:10:39.180 --> 00:10:40.640
--Roger!
--Yeah!
--Got it!

00:10:40.640 --> 00:10:42.640
Lose... hope.

00:10:42.640 --> 00:10:44.220
Four Quarters Meditation!

00:10:44.570 --> 00:10:45.620
Block

00:10:46.330 --> 00:10:47.120
Block

00:10:49.300 --> 00:10:51.300
Single Stroke Slash!

00:10:51.300 --> 00:10:54.470
Protector Knights! Charge!

00:10:56.050 --> 00:10:59.550
If you can't win, you just need
to change things so you can.

00:10:59.550 --> 00:11:03.930
I've got comrades who
can make it possible now!

00:11:03.930 --> 00:11:05.390
Because I've got them...

00:11:05.390 --> 00:11:10.010
Because they fight and win...
I can win, too!

00:11:10.010 --> 00:11:12.760
That's how it is, right, Shiroe?

00:11:12.760 --> 00:11:15.590
So this is what Shiroe
has been experiencing...

00:11:15.590 --> 00:11:18.180
--Maestro Echo!
--Lightning Chamber!
--Serpent Bolt!

00:11:19.590 --> 00:11:21.390
Akatsuki!

00:11:21.390 --> 00:11:23.840
Assassinate!

00:11:25.720 --> 00:11:27.890
Your...

00:11:27.890 --> 00:11:29.890
...subjects...

00:11:29.890 --> 00:11:31.840
...for veneration...

00:11:44.090 --> 00:11:52.930
Guild Building

00:11:44.090 --> 00:11:52.930
Japan Server

00:11:44.090 --> 00:11:52.930
Akiba

00:11:44.090 --> 00:11:46.930
Field: Monsters Present

00:11:44.090 --> 00:11:47.340
PvP Permitted

00:11:46.260 --> 00:11:52.930
No PvP

00:11:46.930 --> 00:11:52.930
Field: No Monsters

00:11:53.550 --> 00:11:56.930
Shiroe!

00:11:56.930 --> 00:12:02.090
Shiroe! We won!

00:12:08.760 --> 00:12:11.550
We made purlenty of food for everyone!

00:12:11.550 --> 00:12:14.720
Please don't hold back and eat a lot!

00:12:13.450 --> 00:12:16.960
"Roderick's Lab Special Mayo"

00:12:14.720 --> 00:12:16.840
We've got mayo, too.

00:12:17.210 --> 00:12:22.460
White-Beam Tree

00:12:17.210 --> 00:12:22.460
Japan Server

00:12:17.210 --> 00:12:22.460
Akiba

00:12:17.760 --> 00:12:22.840
Well, everyone's level has returned
to normal. We live happily ever after.

00:12:17.760 --> 00:12:22.840
We still have a lot of food.

00:12:22.840 --> 00:12:26.590
So the White Snake King
was like, "Roarrrr!"

00:12:26.590 --> 00:12:29.010
and Litka's Sis kicked the enemy a lot!

00:12:29.010 --> 00:12:30.640
I gave him a good strong kick!

00:12:30.640 --> 00:12:36.180
After all, a victory came our way
because I trained them well.

00:12:36.180 --> 00:12:37.800
It's thanks to you, Teto-Teto!

00:12:37.800 --> 00:12:39.510
Thank you very much!

00:12:39.510 --> 00:12:40.760
Yep, yep.

00:12:40.760 --> 00:12:43.470
So give me more scales again, okay?

00:12:43.470 --> 00:12:44.550
What?

00:12:44.550 --> 00:12:47.550
I used so many in the raid.

00:12:47.550 --> 00:12:49.220
About 100,000 of them.

00:12:49.220 --> 00:12:51.390
One hundred... thousand...?

00:12:51.390 --> 00:12:55.640
I'm sorry. She used them
as a catalyst for summoning.

00:12:55.640 --> 00:12:59.470
So, Teto-Teto, please
go collect more for me.

00:12:59.470 --> 00:13:00.640
Shock!

00:13:00.640 --> 00:13:04.090
C-Collecting scales again?!

00:13:04.090 --> 00:13:09.720
Listen! Litka and Sis will join...

00:13:09.720 --> 00:13:11.180
...Log Horizon!

00:13:11.180 --> 00:13:13.260
What?!

00:13:13.260 --> 00:13:17.390
Guild Master Shiroe said that we could
if we go collect scales by ourselves.

00:13:17.390 --> 00:13:20.680
And you, Teto-Teto,
are going to take us to the place!

00:13:20.680 --> 00:13:23.470
Shiroe! You betrayed me!

00:13:23.470 --> 00:13:27.260
I'm the galaxy's number
one starlet, you know!

00:13:27.260 --> 00:13:30.180
Shiroe!

00:13:27.260 --> 00:13:32.300
How should I put it...? This is like
our Guild's routine course of events.

00:13:30.180 --> 00:13:32.300
Naotsugu! Help me!

00:13:32.300 --> 00:13:35.050
It's what you call déjà vu.

00:13:35.050 --> 00:13:38.140
Our Guild will be a lively one.

00:13:38.140 --> 00:13:40.640
Yeah, Nyan-ta.

00:13:43.220 --> 00:13:46.890
I did a terrible thing to Minori.

00:13:46.890 --> 00:13:48.890
Yeah.

00:13:48.890 --> 00:13:53.840
I saw her feelings towards Shiroe
that were overflowing out of her...

00:13:53.840 --> 00:13:57.640
I didn't realize how much she loved him.

00:13:57.640 --> 00:14:04.470
Actually, I didn't understand
what it meant to be in love at all.

00:14:04.470 --> 00:14:09.260
And yet I told her to go out on a date
with him and to confess her love to him.

00:14:09.260 --> 00:14:12.390
I was toying with her.

00:14:12.390 --> 00:14:14.090
Yeah.

00:14:14.090 --> 00:14:17.260
Even when I had...

00:14:17.260 --> 00:14:21.680
...overflowing feelings, too...

00:14:21.680 --> 00:14:23.140
What do I do, Rudy?

00:14:23.140 --> 00:14:26.180
I did a terrible thing to Minori!

00:14:26.180 --> 00:14:28.390
What should I do?

00:14:28.390 --> 00:14:32.640
I wonder what I can do...

00:14:32.640 --> 00:14:34.390
Miss Isuzu.

00:14:34.390 --> 00:14:37.800
You can't do anything, nor should you.

00:14:37.800 --> 00:14:43.050
We all have a door we need to open alone.

00:14:43.050 --> 00:14:47.640
When we open it,
we must go through it alone.

00:14:47.640 --> 00:14:52.050
This is Miss Minori's battle.

00:14:52.050 --> 00:14:55.050
We can't go with her.

00:14:55.050 --> 00:14:57.550
But...!

00:14:57.550 --> 00:15:01.760
I'm sure she knows.

00:15:01.760 --> 00:15:04.470
Miss Minori is a hero.

00:15:04.470 --> 00:15:08.430
She has the strength
to choose the right path.

00:15:08.430 --> 00:15:11.050
And, Miss Isuzu.

00:15:11.050 --> 00:15:13.220
So do you.

00:15:13.220 --> 00:15:15.970
An awkward feeling, a guilty feeling,

00:15:15.970 --> 00:15:18.510
not to mention a
silly feeling like obstinacy

00:15:18.510 --> 00:15:22.180
should not be the cause
for you to let go of her hand.

00:15:22.180 --> 00:15:24.680
Stay with her...

00:15:24.680 --> 00:15:26.470
...since you're her friend.

00:15:27.640 --> 00:15:29.050
Rudy...

00:15:34.680 --> 00:15:37.510
Are you regretting
that you died in the raid?

00:15:37.510 --> 00:15:40.510
Don't be bothered by it.
When it comes to raids,

00:15:40.510 --> 00:15:43.720
you improve by dying a lot.

00:15:43.720 --> 00:15:46.340
Ah... Yeah.

00:15:46.340 --> 00:15:47.930
Where's Minori?

00:15:47.930 --> 00:15:53.800
Oh... She said she wanted
to write up a report for Shiroe.

00:15:53.800 --> 00:15:54.970
I see.

00:15:59.340 --> 00:16:02.890
I kept making mistakes this time.

00:16:02.890 --> 00:16:05.300
I need to get a grip.

00:16:05.300 --> 00:16:10.510
But we're so short-handed,
that's the least of my concerns right now.

00:16:06.400 --> 00:16:10.650
Plan for Sending A 
Goodwill Delegation to 
Minami

00:16:06.400 --> 00:16:10.650
Strictly Confidential

00:16:11.680 --> 00:16:13.050
Shiroe.

00:16:13.050 --> 00:16:15.300
Minori? What're you doing here?

00:16:15.300 --> 00:16:18.680
I wrote a report on today's raid.

00:16:18.680 --> 00:16:22.930
That was quick! Tomorrow or
the day after would've been okay.

00:16:22.930 --> 00:16:30.340
Well, um... If I wait, I thought
I might forget the details.

00:16:30.340 --> 00:16:31.640
Understood.

00:16:35.170 --> 00:16:38.180
Report on the Battle
against Genius Ereinus

00:16:35.760 --> 00:16:38.050
I see...

00:16:41.970 --> 00:16:45.640
Yep. Easy to understand.
It's very well-written.

00:16:45.640 --> 00:16:47.840
Glad to hear that.

00:16:47.840 --> 00:16:51.300
I wasn't able to do
a good job in the raid.

00:16:51.300 --> 00:16:52.550
Is that right?

00:16:52.550 --> 00:16:56.930
I let the battle line collapse once.

00:16:56.930 --> 00:16:59.930
If it weren't for Serara
and Isuzu's remedy,

00:16:59.930 --> 00:17:02.720
I think we would've been wiped out.

00:17:02.720 --> 00:17:05.010
I failed as a raid leader.

00:17:05.010 --> 00:17:07.220
I disagree.

00:17:07.220 --> 00:17:10.050
When it comes to raids,
it's normal to lose.

00:17:10.050 --> 00:17:14.590
But you thought you could do it, right?
I understand that feeling.

00:17:16.840 --> 00:17:20.180
A leader can't win alone.

00:17:20.680 --> 00:17:21.390
Party 4

00:17:20.680 --> 00:17:21.390
Party 2

00:17:20.680 --> 00:17:21.390
Party 1

00:17:20.680 --> 00:17:21.390
Party 3

00:17:22.470 --> 00:17:26.180
No matter who it is,
they can't win a raid alone.

00:17:26.180 --> 00:17:29.760
A leader especially can't
do anything by themselves.

00:17:29.760 --> 00:17:32.260
No matter how miserable you feel,

00:17:32.260 --> 00:17:37.010
if your comrades say that it was a
good command, you should believe it.

00:17:39.660 --> 00:17:41.070
"Tetora Baby's First Recital"

00:17:41.930 --> 00:17:44.640
They did compliment you, right?

00:17:44.640 --> 00:17:48.510
They said, "Let's go again."

00:17:48.510 --> 00:17:52.140
Good. That compliment is yours, Minori.

00:17:52.140 --> 00:17:56.510
You'll definitely become
someone admired by everyone.

00:17:56.510 --> 00:17:57.930
You think so?

00:17:57.930 --> 00:18:02.010
Of course! Why are you
looking like you're about to cry?

00:18:02.010 --> 00:18:04.550
You can become anything.

00:18:04.550 --> 00:18:06.550
Anything you want...

00:18:06.550 --> 00:18:08.640
Whoever you want...

00:18:08.640 --> 00:18:12.340
I'm sure you can make
any wish you have come true.

00:18:16.760 --> 00:18:18.260
I...

00:18:21.260 --> 00:18:23.680
...love you.

00:18:23.680 --> 00:18:24.720
What?

00:18:26.470 --> 00:18:32.890
Since the days when Toya and I had no
friends because this was our first game,

00:18:32.890 --> 00:18:36.090
I've thought you were a wonderful person.

00:18:36.090 --> 00:18:39.090
When you saved us from Hamelin,

00:18:39.090 --> 00:18:43.390
I thought you were such an amazing person.

00:18:43.390 --> 00:18:45.800
As I spent time with you,

00:18:45.800 --> 00:18:48.800
I quickly realized what
a cool person you are.

00:18:48.800 --> 00:18:55.800
You're kind and calm,
so my feelings towards you grew.

00:18:55.800 --> 00:18:59.300
When I see you get
the short end of the stick,

00:18:59.300 --> 00:19:03.760
it makes my heart ache
and it's hard for me.

00:19:03.760 --> 00:19:09.970
I'm still a child and learning
from you is all I've been able to do...

00:19:09.970 --> 00:19:12.220
But I'm in love with you!

00:19:12.220 --> 00:19:15.220
You're my teacher, but I love you so much!

00:19:22.970 --> 00:19:24.430
I'm sorry.

00:19:26.140 --> 00:19:28.390
There's someone I'm in love with.

00:19:28.390 --> 00:19:31.680
It's not that we're dating or anything,

00:19:31.680 --> 00:19:34.510
but I think I'm in love with her.

00:19:34.510 --> 00:19:38.760
When I'm with her, it feels nice.

00:19:38.760 --> 00:19:41.390
The town looks beautiful.

00:19:41.390 --> 00:19:44.180
The time passes by slowly.

00:19:44.180 --> 00:19:47.300
I don't know what'll happen between us,

00:19:47.300 --> 00:19:51.430
but I'm probably in love with her.

00:19:51.430 --> 00:19:53.800
So... I'm sorry.

00:19:55.680 --> 00:19:57.010
Okay.

00:19:59.300 --> 00:20:03.510
I'm all right! I'm sorry
to put you on the spot!

00:20:03.510 --> 00:20:06.930
I may not look it, but I'm pretty tough.

00:20:06.930 --> 00:20:09.430
Even Toya can't beat me in that!

00:20:09.430 --> 00:20:10.890
So I'm fine!

00:20:10.890 --> 00:20:15.840
Good night! I did a lot of paperwork,
so I'm a little tired.

00:20:15.840 --> 00:20:19.010
You do a lot of paperwork
like this every day.

00:20:19.010 --> 00:20:21.550
I think you really are overworked!

00:20:21.550 --> 00:20:23.010
Goodnight!

00:20:43.550 --> 00:20:46.140
We found Minori!

00:20:46.140 --> 00:20:49.470
It's unsafe for a girl to be
out late at night like this.

00:20:49.470 --> 00:20:51.840
Yay! I caught you!

00:20:51.840 --> 00:20:53.180
We caught you!

00:20:53.180 --> 00:20:54.840
What? Um...

00:20:54.840 --> 00:20:56.720
Whoa!

00:20:56.720 --> 00:20:59.590
Isuzu... Serara...

00:21:10.760 --> 00:21:12.800
Minori...

00:21:12.800 --> 00:21:14.340
I'm sorry.

00:21:14.340 --> 00:21:17.890
I'm sorry, Minori.

00:21:17.890 --> 00:21:21.260
I did... tell him...

00:21:21.260 --> 00:21:22.840
Yeah.

00:21:22.840 --> 00:21:24.390
...that I loved him.

00:21:24.390 --> 00:21:26.840
Yeah.

00:21:26.840 --> 00:21:29.180
That it wasn't just admiration.

00:21:29.180 --> 00:21:34.010
I did tell him... that I loved him.

00:21:34.010 --> 00:21:37.010
That they weren't fake feelings.

00:21:37.010 --> 00:21:39.260
That I really loved him.

