00:21:52.180 --> 00:21:54.800
Hey, Isuzu. Sing.

00:21:54.800 --> 00:21:55.890
What?

00:21:55.890 --> 00:21:58.640
Yeah! Sing! Sing!

00:21:58.640 --> 00:22:01.220
Hmm... Well then...

00:22:02.760 --> 00:22:05.760
Laaaa...!

00:22:05.760 --> 00:22:07.090
Your voice is hoarse.

00:22:07.090 --> 00:22:08.010
It sure is.

00:22:08.010 --> 00:22:11.680
I can't help it. Then you sing, Minori.

00:22:11.680 --> 00:22:13.010
Okay!

00:22:13.010 --> 00:22:14.180
Well then...!

00:22:14.180 --> 00:22:16.640
Laaaa...!

00:22:19.090 --> 00:22:22.010
I love you, Minori!

00:22:22.010 --> 00:22:24.550
I do, too, Minori!

00:22:24.550 --> 00:22:25.760
Yep!

00:23:59.140 --> 00:24:04.390
So Shiro, what's this important
discussion you wanted to have?

00:24:04.390 --> 00:24:05.590
Yeah.

00:24:07.180 --> 00:24:09.050
I'm planning to go visit Minami.

00:24:09.050 --> 00:24:10.220
Minami?

00:24:10.220 --> 00:24:13.300
Okay, understood. You can count on me.

00:24:13.300 --> 00:24:16.010
Do you even know
what he's going there for?

00:24:16.930 --> 00:24:20.050
The time has finally come, huh, Shiroechi?

00:24:20.050 --> 00:24:23.970
Oh... going to Minami?

00:24:23.970 --> 00:24:27.470
May I come along?

00:24:24.980 --> 00:24:26.690
The End
